/E (At its core, the solution uses a Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) pipeline to fetch real-time content from trusted sources such as news sites, research papers, and social media. This data is embedded and stored in a vector database, enabling the system to retrieve and synthesize clear summaries and blog topic suggestions using Granite models.)
